OL,3,GNEWSALast car left in condemned
OL,4,Amulti-storey to go
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last car left in a multi-storey car
OL,7,Fpark in a town centre which was closed
OL,8,Fsuddenly two months ago, is set to be
OL,9,Fcollected.
OL,11,FMayorhold Car Park in Lady's Lane in
OL,12,FNorthampton was shut by West
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire Council after
OL,14,Fcrumbling concrete was discovered in
OL,15,Fthe structure.
OL,17,FIt was built more than 50 years ago and
OL,18,Fwas due to be demolished next year as
OL,19,Fpart of the wider Greyfriars
OL,20,Fregeneration programme.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
