OL,3,GNEWSALast car left in condemned
OL,4,Amulti-storey to go
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the owner of the
OL,7,Fsolitary vehicle left in the car park
OL,8,Fwas "making arrangements" for it to be
OL,9,Fcollected.
